Comment: 0,0:22:27.45,0:22:30.20,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HD86CF3&\4c&HCDA8CE&}褒めてくれた君も
Comment: 0,0:22:30.20,0:22:34.25,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HD86CF3&\4c&HCDA8CE&}前から同じの持っていたの?
Comment: 0,0:22:34.25,0:22:39.46,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\c&H42B1F3&\4c&HDE82F5&}WHAT　今更そんなこと
Comment: 0,0:22:39.46,0:22:42.67,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\c&H42B1F3&\4c&HDE82F5&}掘りかえさないでよ
Comment: 0,0:22:42.67,0:22:50.64,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\c&H42B1F3&\4c&HDE82F5&}眩しすぎた日々を離したくないの
Comment: 0,0:22:50.64,0:22:52.76,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE89C29&\4c&HC0D369&}何やってんだろう
Comment: 0,0:22:52.76,0:22:56.77,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE89C29&\4c&HC0D369&}そんな日はさ
Comment: 0,0:22:56.77,0:23:00.56,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE89C29&\4c&HC0D369&}ちゃんと前を向いてるよって
Comment: 0,0:23:00.56,0:23:06.44,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE89C29&\4c&HC0D369&}言ってくれる君が必要なんだ
Comment: 0,0:23:08.20,0:23:11.45,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\an3\c&HF0A7E2&}あぁまた想いが
Comment: 0,0:23:11.45,0:23:15.08,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\an3\c&HF0A7E2&}張り裂けそうなのに
Comment: 0,0:23:15.08,0:23:23.09,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\\shad0\an3\c&HF0A7E2&}URLより短い言葉にしかできないわたしです
Comment: 0,0:23:23.09,0:23:26.76,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\an3\c&HF0A7E2&}Http:// I'm so sad.comでもう
Comment: 0,0:23:26.76,0:23:28.97,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,391)\shad0\an1\c&HDBB0C1&}君に飛べるように
Comment: 0,0:23:29.47,0:23:36.27,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(402,517)\c&H3FB1F4&\4c&HBAC34E&}出会えるように　できてたらな
Comment: 0,0:22:19.48,0:22:24.24,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\c&HD86CF3&\4c&HCDA8CE&}锵  我买了这些东西哦
Comment: 0,0:22:24.24,0:22:27.45,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\c&HD86CF3&\4c&HCDA8CE&}值得夸耀的事物
Comment: 0,0:22:27.45,0:22:30.20,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\c&HD86CF3&\4c&HCDA8CE&}夸赞我的你
Comment: 0,0:22:30.20,0:22:34.25,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\c&HD86CF3&\4c&HCDA8CE&}从前就拥有过了吧?
Comment: 0,0:22:34.25,0:22:39.46,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\c&H42B1F3&\4c&HDE82F5&}什么  事到如今
Comment: 0,0:22:39.46,0:22:42.67,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\c&H42B1F3&\4c&HDE82F5&}不要再去追究了啦
Comment: 0,0:22:42.67,0:22:50.64,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\c&H42B1F3&\4c&HDE82F5&}不想放开这炫目的日常
Comment: 0,0:22:50.64,0:22:52.76,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE89C29&\4c&HC0D369&}我在做什么呢
Comment: 0,0:22:52.76,0:22:56.77,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE89C29&\4c&HC0D369&}在那样的日子
Comment: 0,0:22:56.77,0:23:00.56,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE89C29&\4c&HC0D369&}我们有好好向前走呢
Comment: 0,0:23:00.56,0:23:06.44,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE89C29&\4c&HC0D369&}需要一个对我如此的你
Comment: 0,0:23:08.20,0:23:11.45,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\an7\shad0\c&HDA9F5B&}啊  我的思念
Comment: 0,0:23:11.45,0:23:15.08,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\an7\shad0\c&HDA9F5B&}撕扯着我的心
Comment: 0,0:23:15.08,0:23:23.09,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\an7\shad0\c&HDA9F5B&}只能说出  比URL还要短的言语
Comment: 0,0:23:23.09,0:23:26.76,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\an7\shad0\c&HDA9F5B&}我好难过
Comment: 0,0:23:26.76,0:23:28.97,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\an7\shad0\c&HDA9F5B&}为了能够飞向你
Comment: 0,0:23:29.47,0:23:36.27,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(402,517)\c&H3FB1F4&\4c&HBAC34E&}与你相遇而存在的
